    "insights": [
      "When D₁≡1(4), Jacobi QR factor (-1)^{(D₁-1)/2·(D₂-1)/2}=1 (since (D₁-1)/2 is even), giving exact symmetry J(D₁,D₂)=J(D₂,D₁)",
